  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>Brutus Tag System test world</b>

    <size=80%>1. <b>Pick tags</b>
    on the menu; move the slider to set their height. Rejoin: your picks come back
    (persistence).

    2. <b>Tag mirror</b>: toggle it on to see your own tag; it''s
    hidden while the mirror is off.

    3. <b>Zones</b>: blue floor is zone 1, the
    orange room is zone 2. Stand either side of the doorway: tags of the player in
    the other zone hide.

    4. <b>Distance</b>: stand on the pad behind spawn while
    someone walks down the lane. Past 15 m their tag moves every 2nd frame, past
    30 m every 3rd, past 60 m it hides.

    The status boards show what each tag
    is doing. Test with Build & Test, 2+ clients.</size>'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
